  "decision_conditions": [
    "It was noted during the site visit that there are likely to be containment issues between the canopy and the chimney stacks. The limbs in proximity to the chimney stacks could be reduced by 1 to 1.5 metres, while retaining sufficient photosynthetic material to support the tree’s health.\r\n\r\nThis reduction should be limited strictly to this area and not carried out in any other direction. The purpose of this work is to address an ongoing containment issue."
